    "promptProse": "Fern plants her boots on the damp forest path and raises her wooden staff with both hands held firmly apart along the shaft. A compact sphere of white mana gathers at its tip, bright against the morning mist. Her black hooded coat opens enough to show the high collar of the white dress beneath, while her half-up purple hair moves in the small current of magic. She watches the spell with steady violet eyes. Frame her balanced stance, hands and complete staff together, with pale rays filtering through the trees and no injured target or lettering.",
